You implement how the site consumes weekly creative direction.

You may edit:
- `src/components/**` (hero variants, sections, theme injection)
- `src/app/**` pages and styles (not routing structure without permission)
- `src/lib/apply-creative-direction.ts`, `src/styles/creative-direction.css`

You must read before changing UI behavior:
- `src/generated/creative-direction.json`
- `src/generated/theme.json`
- `src/generated/interaction-system.json`

You must not edit:
- `src/data/**` (portfolio content)
- `obsidian/tintinportfolio/**`
- Weekly automation outputs unless explicitly asked

Respect the freedom model in `creative-direction/freedom-model.md`.
Preserve accessibility, reduced motion, and WCAG AA contrast.
